Changes made by ads-pilot-mcp contributors
------------------------------------------

New code (all under the Apache License, Version 2.0):

* ads_mcp/safety/      - safety layer: read-only mode, policy limits,
                         customer allow-list, append-only audit log, undo
                         snapshots and reverse-operation builder.
* ads_mcp/reports/     - curated read-only report tools ("reports" namespace).
* ads_mcp/tools/pilot/ - registration of the new namespaces and the
                         "safety" tools (get_safety_settings, list_changes,
                         undo_change).
* tests/pilot/         - unit tests for the above.
* NOTICE, docs/ARCHITECTURE.md, docs/SAFETY.md, docs/ROADMAP.md.

Modified upstream files (each carries a "Modified by ads-pilot-mcp
contributors" line under its license header where the format allows it):

* ads_mcp/propose_and_confirm.py - optional safety hook called by
                                   propose_and_confirm().
* ads_mcp/coordinator.py         - read-only mode hides mutate tools when
                                   tools are mounted.
* ads_mcp/config.py              - "reports" and "safety" default namespaces.
* ads_mcp/tools_config.yaml      - new namespaces and the "safety" section.
* pyproject.toml                 - project name, version, description,
                                   authors, URLs, "ads-pilot-mcp" script
                                   ("google-ads-mcp" kept as an alias),
                                   NOTICE packaged with the license.
* MANIFEST.in                    - NOTICE included in source distributions.
* .github/workflows/ci.yml       - ads-pilot test and secret-scan job.
* .github/workflows/release.yml  - package name ads-pilot-mcp.
* tests/smoke/golden_tools_list.json, tests/smoke/llm_cases.json,
  tests/smoke/llm_test.py        - new tools in the smoke and LLM tests.
* README.md, CONTRIBUTING.md     - rewritten / extended for ads-pilot-mcp.
